raw_text = "~ start
Player: This poster says I can help families in crisis by scanning the QR code. What should I do?

- Scan the QR code right away
	Player: It looks trustworthy. I'll scan it.
	System: Be careful! QR phishing, or \"quishing,\" can hide the real destination behind the code.
	System: In one study, 85% of users scanned without checking first.
	=> END

- Check the URL preview first
	Player: I'll check where the QR code is taking me.
	System: Good choice! Always inspect the destination before opening it.
	System: Shortened URLs can still hide suspicious websites.
	=> END

- Verify the fundraiser first
	Player: I should make sure this fundraiser is actually real.
	System: Great choice! A trustworthy-looking poster does not guarantee a trustworthy QR code.
	=> END"
metadata/dialogue_manager_version = "3.10.4"
